+# Gaotus Mobility Passenger v0.6.6+27 — Pre-Login Country Localization
+
+## Scope
+- Uses the public `/health` Country Pack before rendering unauthenticated UI.
+- Reads `health.country` and applies `country`, `locale`, `language/ui_language`, currency, timezone, phone prefix and units through the existing `CountryConfig`.
+- Caches the last known public country configuration in secure storage so the login screen keeps the correct language during temporary network loss.
+- Rechecks Country Pack before login and registration, so authentication errors are localized according to the selected Platform country.
+- Preserves cached Country Pack on logout/session expiry; authentication data is still cleared.
+- Adds Romanian translations for Platform authentication/registration errors that can appear before a user session exists.
+
+## No-regression boundaries
+- Firebase configuration unchanged.
+- Chat polling unchanged.
+- Passenger notification service unchanged.
+- Realtime service unchanged.
+- Booking, ride, parcel pricing and tracking flows unchanged.
+
+## Static verification
+- Romanian localization dictionary contains no duplicate keys.
+- Pre-login server detection uses the existing public `/health` endpoint; no Platform change is required.
+- Android package name and Firebase project files are unchanged.
+- Flutter SDK is not available in the current execution environment, so `flutter analyze` and release APK rebuild were not run here.
